ou play will influence the behaviours they use to hide, deceive and try to kill you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong><i>TWITCH CHAT INTEGRATION</i></strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect your Twitch account to allow chat to influence the game. You can control which commands are available for chat to use, set cooldowns for them, and also set custom text prompts that triggers the commands. Some commands are helpful and some are disruptive. You can fully control which ones are available for your chat to use.    </p>","developers":["Skedaddle Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130660/4ee08495fceca4268eba19a1e1714ae8271c0f3a/header.jpg?t=1769255333","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3130660/694589004/365ebbc016de8359280a1fd74004abb071557035/1769252730/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769255330","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3130660/694589004/365ebbc016de8359280a1fd74004abb071557035/1769252730/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769255330","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3130660/694589004/365ebbc016de8359280a1fd74004abb071557035/1769252730/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769255330","id":257094021,"name":"Sunken Veins Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257094021/3fc444297ca966b65708badd39899e02cb8945f5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769255330"}],"name":"Sunken Veins","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","